      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "0B8703B70EFDCD88",
      "text": "沒錯，普普通通的訓練家\\n大半都會在差不多這時候放棄。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
